# Internal project, team and repository names that must not appear in the
# public tree, kept as digests so this file does not name them either. One
# per line: the name's length in characters, then the SHA-256 of the name in
# lowercase. scripts/check-no-internal-names.sh reads it (the lint job in CI).
#
# To add a name:  printf %s 'name' | tr '[:upper:]' '[:lower:]' | shasum -a 256
# and prepend its length.
